   $q$How does the old beaver's response break the pattern set by the first two animals?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She builds the entire dam for Tull while he watches her work.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She refuses to help and sends Tull back to the heron again.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She gives a shortcut that is even quicker than the other two.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She gives no shortcut and hands him a task to repeat each day.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She gives no shortcut and hands him a task to repeat each day.$q$, $q$The heron and otter offer quick tricks, but the old beaver "did not answer" and gives him one stick and mud to place daily. She does help, just not with a shortcut.$q$, 'draft', '2366d6b8-56e8-5831-85db-6109c8562e2c')
