   $q$What do the opening stage directions reveal that the team does not know?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The controller is running low on power.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-detail"},{"text":"The judges have changed the rules.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A battery clip on the robot is loose.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Another team has already stacked six blocks.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A battery clip on the robot is loose.$q$, $q$The stage directions say, "Unseen by the team, a small battery clip on Pickle's back hangs loose." The problem is with the robot's clip, not the controller.$q$, 'draft', 'c25ef29e-8373-54c9-891b-bb2e40e7550d')
