   $q$According to Ms. Ferreira, what caused Kofi's bowl to break?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A bright orange glaze that cracked.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-details"},{"text":"An air bubble trapped inside the clay.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Leaves carved too deeply into the rim.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"A kiln that was heated far too much.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$An air bubble trapped inside the clay.$q$, $q$Ms. Ferreira says "Air bubble" and points to "a small round hollow inside the break." She never mentions the glaze, and the story never says which bowl is orange.$q$, 'draft', '9877210d-25ae-55e9-8529-b62dfcfc2728')
